.Dd October 16, 2026
.Dt LCC-SOUND-THEME 1
.Os @PROJECT_VERSION@

.Sh NAME
.Nm lcc-sound-theme
.Nd configure the sounds played for Lumina session events.

.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl h | -help
.Op Fl v | -version

.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is part of the Lumina Control Center.
It selects an audio file for each of the following session events, and
enables or disables each one:
.Bl -bullet -offset indent
.It
Startup (login)
.It
Logout
.It
Low battery
.El

.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Display help on command line options.
.It Fl v , Fl -version
Display version information.
.El

.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa /usr/local/bin/lcc-sound-theme
.It Pa $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/lumina-desktop/sessionsettings.conf
Sound file paths are stored in the
.Qq audiofiles
group.
.El

.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr lcc 1 ,
.Xr lcc-session 1

.Sh AUTHORS
.An jt (q5sys)
.Aq jt@obs-sec.com
